{"nodes": [{"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_02_04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis", "label": "Tax Invoice-Receipt 60217 (type 320) \u2014 \u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9 \u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9 \u2014 \u20aa6,254 (04/02/2026)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-02-04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Receipt for a bank transfer dated 02/02/2026 (\u20aa6,254). Its footnote ties it to deal 40222 (\u20aa3,304), but it also bills two shows that are not on that deal \u2014 \u05d7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d9\u05d5 \u05d0\u05dc\u05de\u05d0 16/12 and Boney M 31/12 \u2014 adding \u20aa2,500 net + \u20aa450 VAT = \u20aa2,950. The deal was never amended, so 40222 is fully closed by a larger receipt. Reconciliation should not expect a separate document for the extra \u20aa2,950."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_doc_type_320_tax_invoice_receipt", "label": "Doc Type 320 \u2014 \u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9\u05ea \u05de\u05e1 / \u05e7\u05d1\u05dc\u05d4 (Tax Invoice-Receipt)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-02-04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A combined tax invoice and receipt, issued once payment arrives. It has a \u05e4\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9 \u05ea\u05e9\u05dc\u05d5\u05de\u05d9\u05dd block (method, date, amount) and a footnote linking it to the originating \u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05df \u05e2\u05e1\u05e7\u05d4."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_deal_to_receipt_closing_pattern", "label": "Deal\u2192Receipt Closing Pattern (300 \u2192 320)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-02-04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Work is billed first with a \u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05df \u05e2\u05e1\u05e7\u05d4 (300). When the client pays, a \u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05e0\u05d9\u05ea \u05de\u05e1/\u05e7\u05d1\u05dc\u05d4 (320) is issued, normally for the same amount, with the footnote '\u05e2\u05d1\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05df \u05e2\u05e1\u05e7\u05d4 N' that closes the deal. Revenue and VAT recognition wait until payment, which suits a cash-basis service business."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_gig_julio_alma_2025_12_16", "label": "\u05d7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d9\u05d5 \u05d0\u05dc\u05de\u05d0 show 16/12/2025 (\u20aa1,250)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-02-04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Appears on receipt 60217 but not on deal 40222."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_gig_boney_m_2025_12_31", "label": "Boney M show 31/12/2025 (\u20aa1,250)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-02-04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Appears on receipt 60217 but not on deal 40222."}], "edges": [{"source": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_02_04_type320_num60217_\u05d0\u05d5\u05d3\u05d9_\u05e7\u05e8\u05e0\u05d9_6254nis", "target": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_issuer_itamar_miron_im_productions", "relation": "references", "confid